request.description:
### GET Company

This endpoint sends an HTTP GET request to retrieve a list of companies from the server.

### **Request**

No request body is required for this request.

### **Response**

The response of this request is documented below as a JSON schema.

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "companies": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "location": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "industry": {
            "type": "string"
          }
          // Additional properties may be present based on the server's response
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

 ```

